# BUGS

Realtek's code is loaded only on the RTL8126_2 (firmware/README.md); an RTL8126_1 runs without it, as Linux's driver runs a chip whose firmware file is missing, and its link may take seconds longer to come up.
The RTL8125, of the same family, isn't matched.
